# chorus CEC golden vector: answer to Give System Audio Mode Status (CTS 11.2.15-4).
#
# Committed, never written by a test. Rust-only by declaration (CEC runs on the Linux hub
# alone): crates/cec/tests/fixtures.rs decodes these bytes to system_audio_mode_status_on.fields and encodes the
# fields back to these bytes. Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# header: initiator 5, destination 0
50

# opcode: system_audio_mode_status
7E

# operands
01
